PN,34101
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785584876
OL,3,CDisposable BBQ caused wildfire which
OL,4,Ckilled animals and forced road to close
OL,6,FA wildfire on Staffordshire heathland
OL,7,Fwhich killed animals was started by a
OL,8,Fdisposable barbecue.
OL,10,FFire services were called to the
OL,11,Fheathland on Sherbrook Valley in
OL,12,FCannock Chase at around 6pm on
OL,13,FThursday (30 July).
OL,15,FStaffordshire County Council said the
OL,16,Ffire impacted an area the size of a
OL,17,Ffootball field, which is in a Special
OL,18,FArea of Conservation.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785584876
OL,3,CDisposable BBQ caused wildfire which
OL,4,Ckilled animals and forced road to close
OL,6,FThe council closed Chase Road, from
OL,7,Fthe Camp Road turning to Brocton
OL,8,FNursery, "to reduce the risk of
OL,9,Fsmouldering areas reigniting."
OL,11,FIt is not expected to reopen until
OL,12,FMonday, 3 August, when it will be
OL,13,Freviewed.
OL,15,FAnimals including reptiles and
OL,16,Famphibians died in the blaze.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785584876
OL,3,CDisposable BBQ caused wildfire which
OL,4,Ckilled animals and forced road to close
OL,6,FHayley Coles, Staffordshire County
OL,7,FCouncil's Deputy Leader and Cabinet
OL,8,FMember for Communities and Culture,
OL,9,Fsaid: "I was particularly sad to learn
OL,10,Fthat animals lost their lives in the
OL,11,Fblaze, and a large amount of rare
OL,12,Fheathland habitat was lost.
OL,14,F"The fire service was fortunately able
OL,15,Fto bring the fire under control but we
OL,16,Fmay not be so lucky next time,
OL,17,Fespecially with the site being so
OL,18,Fclose to irreplaceable veteran oak
OL,19,Ftrees. Please stop bringing barbecues
OL,20,Fonto the Chase. This is the
OL,21,Fdevastation they can cause.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785584876
OL,3,CDisposable BBQ caused wildfire which
OL,4,Ckilled animals and forced road to close
OL,6,F"If you regularly use Chase Road,
OL,7,Fplease make alternative plans for your
OL,8,Fjourney over the weekend and we will
OL,9,Fupdate you as soon as it is safe for
OL,10,Fus to reopen the road again."
OL,12,FRich Williams, Group Manager at the
OL,13,FStaffordshire Fire and Rescue Service,
OL,14,Fattended the fire in Brocton. He
OL,15,Fadded: "We believe this fire was
OL,16,Fcaused by a disposable barbeque, which
OL,17,Fare banned on Cannock Chase due to the
OL,18,Fdangers that they pose.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785584876
OL,3,CDisposable BBQ caused wildfire which
OL,4,Ckilled animals and forced road to close
OL,6,F"It is absolutely crucial that people
OL,7,Fadhere to this ban, as incidents like
OL,8,Fthis place significant demand on
OL,9,Fresources during an already very busy
OL,10,Fperiod."
OL,12,FThe Environment Agency previously
OL,13,Fdeclared a drought in the region, with
OL,14,Fresidents asked not to light open
OL,15,Fflames, or use barbecues in country
OL,16,Fparks.
OL,18,FThey were also asked to put all litter
OL,19,Finto designated bins, especially glass
OL,20,Fwhich can start fires when hit by
OL,21,Fsunlight.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/5
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
